  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Both roots are positive <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Sum of the roots,&nbsp;<math><mi>S</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Product of roots,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Discriminant,&nbsp;<math><mi>D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/d0ca30b1-345e-4c6d-af15-d096eefbad69.png\" style=\"width:4.03403in;height:1.04028in\" /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> or <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br />Taking intersection we get <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
